Project Report Submission Guidelines
•
The project report must be submitted as a single PDF file.
•
The report should contain 12–15 pages, including all sections.
•
All sections must follow the prescribed report structure.
•
Figures, tables, algorithms, and references must be properly numbered and
formatted.
•
The report should clearly describe the methodology, experimental results, and
conclusions.
•
The report must be prepared independently, with proper citations, no plagiarism
and AI contents.